==========================================

n8n Self-Hosted Environment Configuration

==========================================

Domain & Reverse Proxy Settings

SUBDOMAIN=n8n
DOMAIN_NAME=yourdomain.com
SSL_EMAIL=your-email@yourdomain.com

Timezone Settings

GENERIC_TIMEZONE=Asia/Hong_Kong
TZ=Asia/Hong_Kong

n8n Security & Execution Settings

N8N_ENCRYPTION_KEY=replace_with_a_strong_random_32_char_string
N8N_USER_MANAGEMENT_JWT_SECRET=replace_with_another_random_secret
EXECUTIONS_DATA_PRUNE=true
EXECUTIONS_DATA_MAX_AGE=168